<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1884873983"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:24.512"><div begin="19.816" end="38.603" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="19.816" end="24.806" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="19.816" end="20.904">这山河</span> <span begin="20.904" end="22.073">清清如</span><span begin="22.073" end="22.593">我</span> <span begin="23.070" end="24.139">淡淡着</span><span begin="24.139" end="24.806">色</span></p><p begin="25.258" end="28.399" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="25.258" end="26.335">如镜中</span><span begin="26.335" end="26.664">映</span><span begin="26.664" end="27.282">出</span><span begin="27.282" end="27.502">的</span><span begin="27.502" end="27.842">轮</span><span begin="27.842" end="28.399">廓</span></p><p begin="28.579" end="33.520" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="28.579" end="29.736">想是那</span> <span begin="29.736" end="30.797">懵懂的</span><span begin="30.797" end="31.438">我</span> <span begin="31.797" end="32.858">低低心</span><span begin="32.858" end="33.520">锁</span></p><p begin="34.015" end="38.603" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="34.015" end="35.056">把你藏</span><span begin="35.056" end="36.176">进了我</span><span begin="36.176" end="36.677">的</span><span begin="37.048" end="37.457">魂</span><span begin="37.457" end="38.603">魄</span></p></div><div begin="41.544" end="1:00.805" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="41.544" end="46.858" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.544" end="42.755">这月色</span> <span begin="42.755" end="43.875">静静如</span><span begin="43.875" end="44.534">我</span> <span begin="44.934" end="45.981">光晕映</span><span begin="45.981" end="46.858">射</span></p><p begin="47.123" end="50.205" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="47.123" end="48.168">映出了</span><span begin="48.168" end="48.536">心</span><span begin="48.536" end="49.097">中</span><span begin="49.097" end="49.318">的</span><span begin="49.318" end="49.648">斑</span><span begin="49.648" end="50.205">驳</span></p><p begin="50.385"